  "effective_date": "2023-01-01",
  "category": "Interventional Radiology / Spine Surgery",
  "description": "Medicare coverage criteria for balloon kyphoplasty and vertebroplasty. Requires acute or subacute osteoporotic vertebral compression fracture (VCF) confirmed by MRI with bone marrow edema <= 4 months old, severe focal pain (NRS >= 6/10), and failure of conservative analgesic management.",
